  "description": "Next season of Major.<br><br>\nAfter the final game of his Seishuu team against the goal he set himself, Kaidou - the team he left to play against, Gorou has no feelings of remorse anymore. Again he decides to take a step forward and challenge himself.<br><br>\nSaying one more time good bye to Shimizu and his friends, he leaves for the USA, where he plans on competing in the Minor League.<br><br>\nThis is where Season 4 starts, in a country that`s foreign to him, a baseball style that`s unknown to him and new friends and strong rivals who share the same love to the game as him. Accompany Gorou in his neverending quest for new challenges. <br><br>\n(Source: AniDB)",
